  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "しばらく、雨宿りでしょうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……俺も折り畳み傘くらい持っておくべきだった\r\nすまん、凛世",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、かまいません……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "──くしゅん",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世、着物が濡れてるじゃないか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気づかなくてすまん！\r\nとりあえず、この上着を着ててくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\nプロデューサーさまに、ご迷惑はかけられません",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう訳にもいかないよ\r\n……仕方ない、ちょっとコンビニに行ってくるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は……\r\n本当に、かまわないのです……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、傘を買ってくるよ\r\nたしか近くに一軒あったはずだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ、お心遣いだけで\r\n充分でございます……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫大丈夫\r\nちょっと濡れるくらい、なんてこと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003020070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ですが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200502/2012003020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いや……しかし、\r\n濡れてる凛世を残していくのも心配だ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、そうだな……すぐにやむかもしれないし、\r\n少し様子を見ようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
